### Criar transação (valor em centavos: 8000 = R$ 80,00)
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{"description": "Compras no mercado", "category": "GROCERIES", "amount": 8000}

### Validação: valor zero retorna 400
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{"description": "Compras no mercado", "category": "GROCERIES", "amount": 0}

### Listar por categoria (GROCERIES, PHARMA ou AUTO)
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions/GROCERIES

### Resumo dos gastos (novo)
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions/summary

### Comando de voz: envia áudio e recebe resposta em MP3
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions/ai
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="recording-1.m4a"
Content-Type: audio/mp4

< ./src/test/resources/audio/recording-1.m4a
--boundary--
